            <profile id="51df-314c-76b7-96dd" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="37b4-aae5-6830-d590" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword and light armour. May ride a warhorse (+3), throwing spear (+2), shield (+2), heavy armour (+1, replaces light), bow (+3), kontos (+3), barding (+4, -1 Movement). Any unit within 12" of the Standard Bearer may re-roll any failed Break tests. 0-1 (Barbarian or Warlord army). (Fall of the West p.45)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="71d5-748e-4504-f8e2" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
