              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Includes Huns and Alans. Sword and bow. May have shield (+1), throwing spear (+1) and lassoes (+1). Light Cavalry. Nomad cavalry. Normally restricted to Central and Eastern barbarian armies. (Fall of the West p.48)</characteristic>
