  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="12cc-327f-580f-6b22" name="Late Barbarian (Fall of the West) - List Notes" publicationId="37b4-aae5-6830-d590" hidden="false">
      <description>LATE BARBARIAN ARMY LIST (Fall of the West, pp.44-48). Percentages are by points. Special rules p.58.

ARMY COMPOSITIONS:
[Barbarian Army - Sea Raiders]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Barbarian Cavalry: up to 0%
  Sea Raiders (including Saxon armies in Britain): characters up to 33%, Barbarian infantry the rest; no cavalry.
[Barbarian Army - Western Barbarians]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Barbarian Infantry: at least 50%
  Barbarian Cavalry: up to 20%
  Western Barbarians: characters up to 33%, Barbarian infantry at least 50%, Barbarian cavalry up to 20% (not steppe cavalry).
[Barbarian Army - Central Barbarians]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Barbarian Infantry: at least 25%
  Barbarian Cavalry: up to 40%
  Steppe Cavalry: up to 20%
  Central Barbarians: characters up to 33%, Barbarian infantry at least 25%, Barbarian cavalry up to 40% (half may be steppe cavalry: Steppe and Noble Steppe Cavalry together up to 20% of the army, i.e. half of the 40% cavalry allowance).
[Barbarian Army - Eastern Barbarians]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Barbarian Infantry: up to 25%
  Barbarian Cavalry: up to 100%
  Eastern Barbarians: characters up to 33%, Barbarian infantry up to 25%, Barbarian cavalry up to 100% (all may be steppe cavalry).
[Barbarian Army - North African]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Barbarian Infantry: up to 25%
  Barbarian Cavalry: up to 100%
  North African: characters up to 33%, Barbarian infantry up to 25%, Barbarian cavalry up to 100%.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
